    "column": 5,
    "file": "test-cases/eslint-snippets/fixture/postgres-import-syntax/adapter-require.ts",
    "line": 9,
    "message": "This call passes db.read into a helper. Name the executor inside the helper (`db.read(sql`…`)`) instead of passing it. Analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value, so this call is not a judged rewrite. Write the SQL as an argument of that executor. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through a passed function."
  },
  {
    "code": "no-mistakes(postgres-no-executor-adapter)",
    "column": 5,
    "file": "test-cases/eslint-snippets/fixture/postgres-import-syntax/adapter-require.ts",
    "line": 10,
    "message": "This call passes r into a helper. Name the executor inside the helper (`r(sql`…`)`, or `const exec = r; exec(sql`…`)`) instead of passing it. Analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value, so this call is not a judged rewrite. Write the SQL as an argument of that executor. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through a passed function."
  },
  {
    "code": "no-mistakes(postgres-no-executor-adapter)",
